  "cover_image": null,
  "social_image": null,
  "body_html": "<p>By <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/+MadsStoumannDK?rel=author\">Mads Stoumann</a></p>\n<p>A while ago, I wrote a blog-post called <a href=\"https://madsstoumann.wordpress.com/2015/11/11/the-curse-of-the-click-delay/\" target=\"_blank\">The Curse Of The Click-Delay</a>, on how to avoid the 300 ms click-delay on touch-devices, using a small JavaScript.</p>\n<p>Since then, iOS has been updated with a new CSS-property:</p>\n<pre class=\"brush: css; title: ; notranslate\" title=\"\">\ntouch-action: manipulation;\n</pre>\n<p>— and <em>that property</em>, along with some other settings, removes the delay without using JavaScript!</p>\n<p>Happy coding!</p>",
